<p><m>\left\lbrace\begin{array}{rrrrrr}\amp  7 \,x\amp +\amp   \, y\amp =\amp 9\\\amp  4 \,x\amp +\amp  3 \, y\amp =\amp 2\\\amp  -23 \, x\amp - \amp 13 \,y\amp =\amp -17\\ \end{array}\right.</m></p>
